5771-25/491823746_1082165884767109_8451810117661691635_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DTlDPgP2_rsQ7kNvwGFle2_&_nc_oc=AdpXL08o-Ixpeo-QFlaJqfjYAzy0NrNaIeUoqrS_LM9WA1XM8N64D_Gkpxqi-zb7iSQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKApfVtWNz5yN7n1retf_BlhA8TNqF_Qait-IQmWSEMXw&oe=6A9D75C8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fast Internet Browser", "keywords": ["browser", "internet", "webbrowser", "adblocker", "video"], "long_description": "Fast Internet Browser is a lightweight web browser for your headset. It opens as a floating panel that you can freely resize \u2014 from a compact window up to cinema size.\n\nBrowse the flat web, watch videos and manage your tabs in a clean, distraction-free interface. Compatible with Meta Quest.\n\nFEATURES\n\u2022 Tabs with a smart memory saver\n\u2022 Built-in blocker for known ad and tracking requests\n\u2022 Pop-up blocker\n\u2022 Search with DuckDuckGo, Google, Bing or Ecosia\n\u2022 Bookmarks and history\n\u2022 Desktop mode per tab\n\u2022 Find in page, pull to refresh, keyboard shortcuts\n\u2022 Session restore: your open tabs survive restarts\n\nPREMIUM FEATURES\n\u2022 Fullscreen video playback\n\u2022 Downloads, managed on an in-app downloads screen\n\u2022 Incognito mode: no history, and cookies from the sites you visit are deleted when the session ends\n\nNote: some DRM-protected streaming services such as Netflix are not supported, and 360\u00b0 and immersive videos are not supported yet.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nYour history, bookmarks and settings stay on your device.\n", "short_description": "A fast, clean browser for the flat web: tabs, video, downloads and a built-in ad blocker.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fibrowser.com/app-vr-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://fibrowser.com/app-vr-tou.html", "publisher_name": "Michael Stollenwerk", "support_website_url": null, "website_